          {
            "id": 747,
            "title": "Questions 15-20",
            "description": "\n<p>What does the manager say about each of the following aspects of the company policy for apprentices? Write the correct letter, A, B or C, next to Questions 15-20.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Company policy for apprentices</strong></p>",
            "part_id": 6511,
            "question_type": "MATCHING_ENDINGS",
            "question_count": 6,
            "content": "<div class=\"note-completion-content\"><p> </p>\n<p><strong>Company policy for apprentices</strong></p>\n<p>Using the internet          <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"note_comp_15\">______</span></p>\n<p>Flexible working             <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"note_comp_16\">______</span></p>\n<p>Booking holidays            <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"note_comp_17\">______</span></p>\n<p>Working overtime           <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"note_comp_18\">______</span></p>\n<p>Wearing trainers              <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"note_comp_19\">______</span></p>\n<p>Bringing food to work     <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"note_comp_20\">______</span></p></div>",
            "option_title": "",
            "options": [
              {
